B.azi=new A.am("How fast is emergency delivery?","Emergency orders go to the nearest partner store and a rider brings them to you. The estimated arrival time is shown before you pay and updates live while the order is on its way.")
B.ayq=new A.am("How do I track or cancel an order?","Open Profile \u2192 My orders. An order that is on its way opens live tracking. While an order can still be cancelled, its screen shows a Cancel option.")
